        ("What is the best badminton club-night software?",
         "For a typical UK club night - a mixed-strength group, a few courts, people arriving late and leaving early - start with ePegboard. It is free for clubs and it is built around the specific moment a court becomes free. If your real problem is collecting money rather than choosing games, ShuttleStats is the better first call; if you need to run without a reliable internet connection, Court Manager or ShuttlSync."),
